  "notes": [
    {
      "id": "note_1",
      "title": "Little Things to Remember About Anxinie 🤍",
      "date": "Nov 18, 2026",
      "snippet": "Peach iced tea, hates cucumbers, gets homesick when winter begins...",
      "locked": false,
      "content": "THINGS ANXINIE LOVES & NEEDS:\n- Loves peach iced tea (50% sugar, less ice).\n- Hates cucumbers with a passion (pick them out of kimbap for him).\n- When he misses Chongqing or his family, make tomato egg noodles late at night.\n- Always gets cold hands after music show dry runs—keep hand warmers in my bag.\n- Loves sleeping on the left side of our bed facing the window.\n- Needs gentle hugs when choreo practice gets overwhelming.\n- Tells me 'Wo ai ni' in Chinese whenever he thinks I'm asleep."
    },
    {
      "id": "note_2",
      "title": "Private Diary - For Anxinie",
      "date": "Dec 04, 2026",
      "snippet": "LOCKED NOTE • Our secret rooftop confession & promise.",
      "locked": true,
      "pin": "1221",
      "pinHint": "Hint: Our anniversary date (1221)!",
      "content": "TO MY ANXINIE \n===================================\nDecember 21st.\n\nTwo years ago on that studio choom schedule when you asked for my number and confessed that you liked me, I was terrified. We were rookies about to debut and the entire world expected different things from us.\n\nEvery day since then, keeping our love hidden has been our sweetest, most precious secret. When we stand together on stages before tens of thousands of fans, hearing you harmonize next to me gives me courage I never knew I had.\n\nI promise you, Anxinie:\nNo matter how chaotic this industry gets, no matter how many schedules they throw at us, I will always be your home and you are my whole heart.\n\nHappy 500 days, my love.\n\n— 상원"
    }
  ],
